type: software
title: "Pupillary Contrast Response Analysis Code"
abstract: "MATLAB analysis and modeling code for investigating pupillary light reflex (PLR) and pupillary contrast responses in mice and humans. Includes tools for sigmoidal curve fitting, temporal frequency analysis, and optical transfer function modeling for different photoreceptor types."
